intent: Explain the editions in the public README and resync the agent skill copies (tasks 00da06fc, 639ad63b; goal ship-community-team-enterprise-editions). Why: the install section handed out the Community binary without saying so, and gave no path to Team or Enterprise. What: the Install section now names the edition every installer delivers, the archive naming (nool-<version>-community-<target> with .sha256 and the signed SHA256SUMS manifest the installer verifies), and an Upgrading section with nool admin account trial, nool admin account activate <key> and nool upgrade --edition team|enterprise, exit code 4 for higher-edition commands, offline lease verification and the degrade-to-Community rule. Skills.md and skills/nool-commands/{SKILL,Commands}.md are byte-for-byte copies of Nool/skills/nool-commands at the editions knot (One identity, exit 4, --through, --traceability).
